# Youku ad filtering - stable baseline
# Keep the filename youku-v1.snippet for compatibility with existing remote rewrite entries.
#
# Verified behavior:
# 1) UPS pre-roll ads: youku-commercial-v1.js clears data.data.ad.seats and BFSTREAM,
#    removes vip_tips, and leaves the main-content stream/video untouched.
# 2) UPS commercial Banner sub-videos: keep the exact owner + title match, then clear
#    the matched commercial asset's playback stream.
# 3) Free-content pl-ali M3U8: at request time, replace only advInfo with an empty array []
#    to suppress a separate dynamic ad-stitching path; leave all other parameters unchanged.
# 4) M3U8 response diagnostics/removal experiments are no longer in the production path.
#    Diagnostic and filter scripts are retained only for future troubleshooting.
# 5) Confirmed HTTPS ad paths continue to be rejected at the rewrite layer.
# 6) The "Study Moment" item blocks only the single confirmed H5 landing page and the
#    single confirmed asset URL; do not broaden the rule to shared public domains.
# 7) The kuflix_space -> data={} experiment was reverted because it breaks normal playback.
#    Do not restore it.

# ===== Youku UPS: pre-roll ads + commercial Banner =====
^https:\/\/un-acs\.youku\.com\/gw\/mtop\.youku\.play\.ups\.appinfo\.get\/1\.1(?:\?.*)?$ url script-response-body https://raw.githubusercontent.com/clxmhcs/quantumult-X-fenliu/main/AdRewrite/Youku/youku-commercial-v1.js

# ===== Free-content M3U8: request-side advInfo=[] =====
^https?:\/\/pl-ali\.youku\.com\/playlist\/m3u8(?:\?.*)?$ url script-request-header https://raw.githubusercontent.com/clxmhcs/quantumult-X-fenliu/main/AdRewrite/Youku/youku-m3u8-request-v1.js

# ===== Third-party ad components / Youku commercial assets =====
^https?:\/\/lf-cdn-tos\.bytescm\.com\/obj\/static\/ad\/.*$ url reject
^https?:\/\/youku-crm-product\.youku\.com\/creative-center\/.*$ url reject

# ===== Home-page Study Moment: exact-match blocking =====
^https:\/\/o\.youku\.com\/m\/u07ljj6bit(?:\?.*)?$ url reject
^https?:\/\/liangcang-material\.alicdn\.com\/prod\/upload\/e87cf4ecc6b24721b068dccf9500ad9a\.webp\.jpg(?:\?.*)?$ url reject

hostname = un-acs.youku.com, pl-ali.youku.com, lf-cdn-tos.bytescm.com, youku-crm-product.youku.com, o.youku.com, liangcang-material.alicdn.com
